      "content": "interesting. can you go deeper on a few of those? specifically the ones you put at the bottom like \"turnt\" or things like \"no cap\" and \"on god\". when you say they feel \"street\" or \"niche,\" what is the actual demographic profile for those? like, if a luxury brand wanted to use them, would it come off as \"unrefined\" or just \"low class\" to a high-end consumer?",
